<title>ECUADOR: TENNIS-ECUADOR TAKE WINNING DAVIS CUP LEAD OVER URUGUAY.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ECUADOR TAKE WINNING DAVIS CUP LEAD OVER URUGUAY.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1996-09-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of reverse singles matches in the Davis Cup tennis American zone group two final tie between Ecuador and Uruguay on Sunday:</p>
<p>Results (Ecuador names first):</p>
<p>Nicolas Lapenti beat Marcelo Filippini 6-4 6-3 2-6 6-2</p>
<p>Ecuador take unbeatable 3-1 lead.</p>
</text>
